---
// Hero section following Vercel DESIGN.md: tightly tracked display headline, mono eyebrow, mesh gradient bloom
---

<section class="relative pt-12 pb-16 md:pt-20 md:pb-24 vercel-hero-mesh overflow-hidden border-b border-[#ebebeb]">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center relative z-10">
    <!-- Technical Eyebrow -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/90 border border-[#ebebeb] shadow-xs mb-6 backdrop-blur-xs">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
      <span class="mono-eyebrow text-[#4d4d4d] text-[11px]">
        100% Client-Side Neural AI • Zero Server GPU • 100M Parameters
      </span>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Headline with tight tracking -->
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#171717] text-balance leading-[1.08] mb-6">
      Clone your voice.<br class="hidden sm:inline" />
      Synthesize speech in your browser.
    </h1>

    <!-- Subtitle -->
    <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#4d4d4d] max-w-2xl mx-auto text-pretty leading-relaxed mb-8">
      Powered by Kyutai’s open-source <strong>Pocket TTS</strong> model. Generate natural, human speech and clone voices directly in WebAssembly—your audio and text never leave your device.
    </p>

    <!-- CTAs and Feature Pills -->
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 text-xs">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] text-[#4d4d4d] shadow-2xs">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-600" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2" />
          <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4" />
        </svg>
        <span>100% Device Privacy</span>
      </div>

      <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] text-[#4d4d4d] shadow-2xs">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-blue-600" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M12 2v20M17 5v14M7 8v8" />
        </svg>
        <span>Mimi 24kHz Acoustic Codec</span>
      </div>

      <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] text-[#4d4d4d] shadow-2xs">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-purple-600" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="m12 3-1.912 5.813a2 2 0 0 1-1.275 1.275L3 12l5.813 1.912a2 2 0 0 1 1.275 1.275L12 21l1.912-5.813a2 2 0 0 1 1.275-1.275L21 12l-5.813-1.912a2 2 0 0 1-1.275-1.275L12 3Z" />
        </svg>
        <span>Zero-Shot Voice Cloning</span>
      </div>

      <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] text-[#4d4d4d] shadow-2xs">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-600" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
          <path d="m4.93 4.93 4.24 4.24M14.83 9.17l4.24-4.24M14.83 14.83l4.24 4.24M9.17 14.83l-4.24 4.24" />
        </svg>
        <span>Zero Signup & No Limits</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
